46
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:25,420
Senpai, it looks like there's
another jar buried here.

47
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,520
Bring that one too.

48
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,220
Coming!

49
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,860
What is this? It's pretty big!

50
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:36,640
One, two, three!

51
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:51,040
Hahaha!

52
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,620
How many? How many?

53
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,520
What are we digging up?

54
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,640
You're so melodramatic.

55
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,340
Just because we dug up a fallen samurai,

56
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:05,780
but what if there's a curse or something?

57
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:08,200
Why be scared of such unrealistic things?

58
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,360
Instead,
look at the reality right in front of you.

59
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:13,960
That jar full of gold coins is all ours!

60
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,720
Honda!

61
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,480
Let's say one gold coin
is worth 100,000 yen.

62
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:22,600
Well, that's about 50 tsubo's worth, so...

63
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:30,040
A hundred... five billion, five billion!
It's the real deal!

64
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:38,420
With five billion, you can have anything you want!
Try giving Otohime 7 matching luxury motorbikes, Nakagawa.

65
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:42,140
That's how it is! Better than just living

66
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:45,920
Whoa, so what are we going to do, Nakagawa?

67
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,220
I'll follow you, senpai.

68
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:50,980
Good.

69
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:53,700
Alright, let's take a look
at the treasure right away!

70
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:55,020
Hold this down for a sec.

71
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:55,360
Yes.

72
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:02,340
Ow it's a curse!

73
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:05,200
Somebody, help me!

74
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,200
I walked right into it myself!

75
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,100
It's an evil spirit!

76
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:13,100
Eek, eek, eek, eek!

77
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:13,500
Help!

78
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:32,180
Ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow
ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow

79
