80
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:36,000
It's just some old lady!

81
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,220
What on earth happened?

82
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:41,140
If you run the microwave and the
air conditioner at the same time...

83
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:42,820
...the breaker trips, you see.

84
00:06:42,820 --> 00:06:44,320
I thought it would be something like that.

85
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,220
Let's see, let's see.

86
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,740
Let's hold it down tight.

87
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,400
Geez, fine.

88
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:55,420
Okay, then let's start over.

89
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:56,540
Nakagawa, hold it down!

90
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:58,880
Senpai, shouldn't we just stop?

91
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:03,000
So you're saying you don't want the luxury bike,
Nakagawa.

92
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:04,680
No, I do want it, but...

93
00:07:04,980 --> 00:07:06,140
But the curse...

94
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:08,300
If you want it, just hold it down already!

95
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:08,900
Yes!

96
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,100
Can't you hear that, senpai!

97
00:07:14,820 --> 00:07:17,800
Look, it's the wail of a fallen samurai's ghost,
I'm sure of it!

98
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,380
What, Gyaru-kun!

99
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:23,220
No way! I'm going to be possessed!

100
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:26,020
