this is what's making the noise.

101
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:29,820
Saori!

102
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:32,000
What's wrong, Sakonji?

103
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:35,720
After finally getting to the point
where I could confess to Saori,

104
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:39,480
the power outage just
now wiped out all the data.

105
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,640
Do you understand, Honda-kun?

106
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,120
Yes.

107
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:45,080
This time I'm really going to open it.

108
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:45,680
Yes.

109
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:45,780
Yes.

110
00:07:56,860 --> 00:08:00,580
Eeek! Bababa...
I'm sorry, please forgive me!

111
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,440
Please don't curse me, I beg you!

112
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,700
What the heck is this?

113
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:07,380
Let's stop, there's some
human head or something in here!

114
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,520
It's the curse of a fallen samurai!

115
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:12,160
Shut up! Lift it up and we'll see for sure!

116
